ps://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> Do you mean using:\r\n`Input.call_deferred(&\"set_mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)`\r\ninstead of:\r\n`Input.set_deferred(&\"mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)`\r\n\r\nI mean `Input.set_deferred(&\"mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)` instead of using `call_deferred`, I'm not sure what you meant by using `call_deferred` instead of `set_deferred`, I've suggested using `set_deferred` all along\r\n\r\nEdit: maybe there's some language barrier or some other issue as we seem to be talking at cross purposes and not quite getting through to each other","created_at":"2026-09-09T20:08:55Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T21:17:05Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336#discussion_r3972564264","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3972564264"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336#discussion_r3972564264"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3972564264/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":927,"original_line":927,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3969818123,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3975697679","pull_request_review_id":5162899466,"id":3975697679,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7s-FUP","diff_hunk":"@@ -924,6 +924,7 @@\n \t\t</member>\n \t\t<member name=\"mouse_mode\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_mouse_mode\" getter=\"get_mouse_mode\" enum=\"Input.MouseMode\">\n \t\t\tControls the mouse mode.\n+\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] When capturing the mouse in an event handler, it will stop the propagation of this event. If you want the event to keep propagating, use [method Object.call_deferred].","path":"doc/classes/Input.xml","commit_id":"588f16c15b6cc2acc0c867a3d5bf0b37cff83670","original_commit_id":"588f16c15b6cc2acc0c867a3d5bf0b37cff83670","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Not a language barrier, I just got my wires crossed in the middle of the many edits I did while working on the answer.\r\nAnd there was some ambiguity with the rest of the message.\r\nSorry about that :/\r\nHowever, I don't know enough to differenciate set_deferred + variable from call_defered + accessor \r\nAlso I didn't know that:\r\n> generally it's discouraged to use setters directly\r\n\r\nSo next iteration (with or without example?): \r\n\r\nIf you're setting the mouse_mode to MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED while handling a mouse event, the mouse event will stop propagating to the next event handlers.\r\nIf you want the mouse event to keep propagating, you should defer setting the mouse_mode with [method Object.set_deferred] to capture the mouse after all event handler have been executed.\r\n`Input.set_deferred(&\"mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)`\r\n\r\nAnd given all the changes, I'd put that on MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED instead of the setter.","created_at":"2026-09-10T04:58:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T05:14:28Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336#discussion_r3975697679","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3975697679"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336#discussion_r3975697679"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3975697679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":927,"original_line":927,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3969818123,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3975774956","pull_request_review_id":5162998629,"id":3975774956,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc7s-YLs","diff_hunk":"@@ -924,6 +924,7 @@\n \t\t</member>\n \t\t<member name=\"mouse_mode\" type=\"int\" setter=\"set_mouse_mode\" getter=\"get_mouse_mode\" enum=\"Input.MouseMode\">\n \t\t\tControls the mouse mode.\n+\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] When capturing the mouse in an event handler, it will stop the propagation of this event. If you want the event to keep propagating, use [method Object.call_deferred].","path":"doc/classes/Input.xml","commit_id":"588f16c15b6cc2acc0c867a3d5bf0b37cff83670","original_commit_id":"588f16c15b6cc2acc0c867a3d5bf0b37cff83670","user":{"login":"hogoww","id":21278554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMjc4NTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21278554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww","html_url":"https://github.com/hogoww","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hogoww/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Actually, I just tried on my MRE.\r\nAnd I'm not well enough verse in the engine to know why but:\r\n- Both using `Input.set_deferred(&\"mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)` or `Input.call_deferred(&\"set_mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)` are behaving indeterministicaly. Sometimes it passes the event, sometimes it doesn't (In the MRE, click/print/unclick, sometime click/unclick/print).\r\n- ~~using `Input.set_deferred(&\"set_mouse_mode\", Input.MOUSE_MODE_CAPTURED)` is consistantly passing the event to the next handler (In the MRE, click/print/unclick).~~\r\n\r\n~~Which sounds super weird obviously, given that set_deferred shouldn't be used on a method AFAIK.~~\r\nThat also means that the solution I'm proposing is imperfect (or should it be an engine bug ? idk).\r\nI'd still tend to at least being explicit about why the event is not propagading anymore.\r\n\r\nAlthough tested only on a 100 ish click each, so maybe that was within some margin of error or something ? \r\nAgain, I'm making educated guess only here.\r\n\r\nEDIT:\r\nThis wasn't capturing the mouse.\r\nWhich makes more sense.","created_at":"2026-09-10T05:13:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-10T19:41:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336#discussion_r3975774956","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3975774956"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123336#discussion_r3975774956"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123336"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/3975774956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":927,"original_line":927,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":3969818123,"author_association":"NONE","original_position":4,"position":4,"subject_type":"line"}]